<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP CLOSE SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP CLOSE SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the third day of four-day Red Stripe Cup matches on Monday:</p>
<p>In St George's, Grenada: Barbados 161 and 167, Windward Islands 166.</p>
<p>In St John's, Antigua: Leeward Islands 352, Trinidad and Tobago 26-2.</p>
